  "pool": "paper",
  "stem": "If \\(\\frac{x}{y} = 3\\), where \\(y \\ne 0\\), what is the value of \\(\\frac{x^{2} - y^{2}}{xy}\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "8/3"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Substitute \\(x = 3y\\): \\(\\frac{9y^{2} - y^{2}}{3y^{2}} = \\frac{8y^{2}}{3y^{2}}\\).",
    "This equals \\(\\frac{8}{3}\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
  "verify": "y = symbols('y', nonzero=True)\nx = 3*y\nans = simplify((x**2 - y**2) / (x*y))\nassert ans == Rational(8, 3)\nassert len(spr_answers) == 1 and Rational(spr_answers[0]) == ans",
